<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-hanshu" book-id="b-hanshu-063" chapter-id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi" source-id="s-hanshu-063-wuwuzi">
  <p id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0000" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAA">孝武皇帝</persName>六男<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0006" ref="l5c_h8i_d5q">衛皇后</persName>生<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0010" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAD">戾太子</persName><persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0013" ref="gd9_jxj_uqe">趙婕妤</persName>生<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0017" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAE">孝昭帝</persName><persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0020" ref="3eo_u7e_pxx">王夫人</persName>生<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0024" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAA">齊懐王閎</persName><persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0028" ref="4tr_2rn_38x">李姬</persName>生<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0031" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAB">燕刺王旦</persName><persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0035" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAC">廣陵厲王胥</persName><persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0040" ref="52o_i25_ekg">李夫人</persName>生<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:sons:p001:m0044" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAF">昌邑哀王髆</persName></p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:changyi:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:changyi:p001:m0000" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAF">昌邑哀王髆</persName>天漢四年立十一年薨子<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:changyi:p001:m0015" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAFA">賀</persName>嗣立十三年<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:changyi:p001:m0021" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAE">昭帝</persName>崩無嗣大將軍<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:changyi:p001:m0029" ref="eug_nzm_5pu">霍光</persName>徴<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:changyi:p001:m0032" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAFA">王</persName><persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:changyi:p001:m0033" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAFA">賀</persName>典䘮</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:deposition:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:deposition:p001:m0000" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAFA">王</persName>受皇帝璽綬襲尊號即位二十七日行淫亂<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:deposition:p001:m0018" ref="eug_nzm_5pu">大將軍</persName>先與羣臣議白<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:deposition:p001:m0027" ref="1kj_vhc_cx9_AA">孝昭皇后</persName>廢<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:deposition:p001:m0032" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAFA">賀</persName>歸故國賜湯沐邑二千戸<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:deposition:p001:m0043" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAFA">故王</persName>家財物皆與<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:deposition:p001:m0050" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAFA">賀</persName>及<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:deposition:p001:m0052" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAF">哀王</persName><rs id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:deposition:p001:m0054" type="unresolved">女四人</rs>各賜湯沐邑千戸語在霍光傳國除為山陽郡</p>
  <p id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:enfeoffment:p001" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter">其眀年春廼下詔曰葢聞<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:enfeoffment:p001:m0010" ref="a00_ney_bf4">象</persName>有罪<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:enfeoffment:p001:m0013" ref="ddb_l4j_4j2">舜</persName>封之骨肉之親析而不殊其封<persName id="c-hanshu-063-wuwuzi:enfeoffment:p001:m0026" ref="yqp_nlb_p1p_ACAAFA">故昌邑王賀</persName>為海昬侯食邑四千户</p>
</text>
